# Post Install notes

update system
```sh
pkg update
```

upgrade system
```sh
pkg upgrade
```

Install required packages
```sh
pkg install sudo fzf htop flock ImageMagick7 dejavu noto-basic noto-emoji i3 i3lock i3status dmenu rofi polybar dunst feh arandr xterm bash git curl wget neovim micro ncdu nnn figlet xf86-video-vesa xorg alacritty lxappearance gtk3 dhcpcd firefox python3 xclip autocutsel starship unzip vscode calcurse py39-i3ipc doas qpwgraph maim papirus-icon-theme materia-gtk-theme adwaita-icon-theme gtk-murrine-engine 
```

visudo and uncomment line
```content
# %wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL
```

add user to correct groups
```sh
pw groupmod wheel -m user
pw groupmod video -m user
```

add to /usr/local/etc/doas.conf
```content
permit nopass :wheel cmd shutdown
permit nopass :wheel cmd reboot
```

Change shell to bash
```sh
chsh -s /usr/local/bin/bash
```

add to /boot/loader.conf
```content
kern.vty=vt
```

Download nerd font and unzip in ~/.local/share/fonts
```bash
mkdir -p ~/.local/share/fonts && \
curl -L -o /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/releases/download/v3.4.0/JetBrainsMono.zip && \
unzip -o /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip -d ~/.local/share/fonts && \
rm /tmp/JetBrainsMono.zip
```

sysrc wireplumber_enable="YES"
sysrc pipewire_enable="YES"
sysrc dhcpcd_enable="YES"
sysrc dbus_enable="YES"

service dhcpcd start


## User Actions

make ~/.xinitrc with:
```content
. ~/.profile
exec i3
```

Install weather app
```bash
curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apapamarkou/lazy-weather/main/install | bash
```



